{
  "title": "Press Release Services | Distribution, AI Visibility & Monitoring | PressCosmos",
  "description": "Eight services that cover the full announcement lifecycle: newswire distribution, AI visibility (AEO/GEO/LLMO), media monitoring, analytics, branded newsrooms, SEO PR, crisis comms and investor relations.",
