  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><span aria-current=\"page\">Services</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Services</p>\n        <h1>Everything between writing the announcement and proving it worked.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">You can buy any of these on its own. Most teams run distribution plus monitoring first, then add AI visibility once they see how often an assistant answers a question about their category.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"pricing.html\">Compare plans</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"contact.html\">Book a walkthrough</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos provides eight services: newswire distribution, an AI Visibility Suite covering AEO/GEO/LLMO, media monitoring, analytics and attribution, branded newsroom hosting, SEO PR, crisis communications and investor relations distribution. They can be bought individually or combined in one campaign.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    <div class=\"card-grid\">\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.5 12.5 20 4l-6.2 16-2.4-6.1z\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Newswire Distribution</h3>\n  <p>Tiered newswire delivery to 2,400+ media destinations, trade desks and aggregators, with translation, targeting and pickup reporting.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Tier 1 to Tier 4 distribution ladders</li><li>Country, state and metro-level targeting</li><li>24 languages including RTL scripts</li><li>Multimedia embeds and PDF media kits</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"distribution.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6.3 6.3l2.4 2.4M15.3 15.3l2.4 2.4M17.7 6.3l-2.4 2.4M8.7 15.3l-2.4 2.4\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>AI Visibility Suite</h3>\n  <p>AEO, GEO and LLMO engineering so your announcement is quotable by ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity and AI Overviews — not just indexed by search.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Entity and knowledge-graph optimisation</li><li>Answer-engine formatted release blocks</li><li>llms.txt and machine-readable syndication</li><li>Share-of-answer tracking across 9 AI engines</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"ai-visibility.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 12 19 5\"/><path d=\"M3.6 14.4A9 9 0 1 0 9 3.7\"/><path d=\"M7.2 14.9A4.6 4.6 0 1 0 9.4 8.3\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.6\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Media Monitoring</h3>\n  <p>Real-time pickup tracking across 180,000+ sources with sentiment scoring, journalist alerts and competitive share-of-voice.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Live pickup map and coverage feed</li><li>Sentiment and tone scoring</li><li>Journalist and outlet alerts</li><li>Competitor share-of-voice</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"media-monitoring.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Analytics & Attribution</h3>\n  <p>Prove PR impact with referral traffic, backlink quality, AI citation share and revenue attribution in one dashboard.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Referral and backlink equity reporting</li><li>AI citation and share-of-answer metrics</li><li>Pipeline and revenue attribution</li><li>Board-ready PDF exports</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"analytics.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v15\"/><path d=\"M15 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8\"/><path d=\"M8 8h3M8 12h3M8 16h3M2 21h20\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Branded Newsroom</h3>\n  <p>A hosted, indexable newsroom on your own domain so every announcement compounds authority instead of scattering across the web.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Custom domain and full brand control</li><li>NewsArticle and Organization schema</li><li>Journalist resources and media assets</li><li>Auto-generated RSS and JSON feeds</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"newsroom-hosting.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m20 20-3.6-3.6\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>SEO PR</h3>\n  <p>Keyword-mapped headlines, entity-rich body copy and contextual backlinks that earn rankings without reading like advertising.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Search-intent mapped headlines</li><li>Natural anchor distribution</li><li>Editorial review for spam compliance</li><li>Rank tracking for target terms</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"seo-pr.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7.5 3v6c0 4.6-3.1 7.9-7.5 9-4.4-1.1-7.5-4.4-7.5-9V6z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2.2 2.2L15.5 10\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Crisis Communications</h3>\n  <p>Rapid-response statement distribution with 24/7 standby editors, holding statements and coordinated regional rollout.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>60-minute emergency publishing lane</li><li>Standby editor on every plan tier</li><li>Holding statement templates</li><li>Follow-up correction distribution</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"crisis-communications.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17.5 9 11l4 4 8-8.5\"/><path d=\"M21 6.5v5h-5\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Investor Relations</h3>\n  <p>Regulation-aware earnings, funding and material-news distribution built for analyst desks and financial data terminals.</p>\n  <ul class=\"ticks\"><li>Earnings window scheduling</li><li>Analyst and terminal delivery</li><li>Multilingual regulatory variants</li><li>Quiet-period controls and approvals</li></ul>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"investor-relations.html\">See details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n</article></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Choose your path</p>\n      <h2>Most teams fit one of these three shapes</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    <article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <h3>One big announcement</h3><p>Launch, funding, acquisition or a product moment you need to land properly.</p>\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Distribution (Amplify or Newsmaker)</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>AI visibility formatting</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Pickup and citation report</span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"pricing.html\">See per-release plans <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <h3>A steady news rhythm</h3><p>Weekly or monthly releases that should compound into authority instead of scattering.</p>\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Studio plan with 12 releases a month</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Branded newsroom on your domain</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Quarterly AI citation audit</span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"newsroom-hosting.html\">Explore the newsroom <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article><article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n      <h3>Agency or enterprise</h3><p>Multi-client workspaces, approval chains and white-label reporting.</p>\n      <ul class=\"list-check\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>Volume pricing and workspaces</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>White-label dashboards</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m4.5 12.5 5 5 10-10\"/></svg><span>API and automation</span></li></ul>\n      <p class=\"mt-3\"><a class=\"link-arrow\" href=\"agencies.html\">For agencies <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15\"/><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band\" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;display:inline-flex\">Get started</p>\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:1rem\">Put your next announcement in front of the people who act on it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mx-auto\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;max-width:60ch\">Launch in under an hour. Editorial review, distribution, monitoring and AI visibility in one place.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-lg\" href=\"submit.html\">Submit a press release</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"pricing.html\">See pricing</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"mono faint mt-3\">No subscription required · Cancel anytime · Human editorial review on every release</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
  "priority": 0.9
